# Axis values for a control setpoint. Fill x/y/z for translational commands
# (position in m or linear velocity in m/s); fill yaw/pitch/roll for rotational
# commands (attitude in rad or angular rate in rad/s). The unused triple is
# ignored by the topic it is published on.
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
float64 yaw
float64 pitch
float64 roll
